## 🌟 Overview

**AetherMind Multimodal AI** transforms traditional AI assistants into a unified multimodal workspace. Built with high-performance Python FastAPI, Qdrant Vector DB, PostgreSQL, and modern Vanilla JS glassmorphism UI, AetherMind brings together:

- 💬 **Unified Multimodal Chat Engine**: Seamlessly switch between Google Gemini 2.5, OpenAI GPT-4o, Anthropic Claude 3.5, and local Ollama models with automated provider failover.
- 📄 **Document Intelligence RAG**: Upload PDF, DOCX, CSV, Excel, or TXT files. Automatic chunking, vector embedding, and context-aware RAG Q&A.
- 🖼️ **Vision AI & Text-to-Image Engine**: Scene understanding, object recognition, handwritten notes OCR, plus HD text-to-image generation with aspect ratio and quality selection.
- 🎙️ **Voice & Audio Processing**: Web Audio recording, real-time wave visualization, and speech-to-text transcription.
- 🧠 **Long-Term Memory Dashboard**: Autonomous memory compression, pin key facts, filter preferences, and maintain contextual continuity.
- 📚 **Knowledge Base & Collections**: Organize enterprise documents into distinct Qdrant vector collections with dense + sparse hybrid search capabilities.
- 📁 **Cloud Workspace & Productivity**: Manage Projects, Folders, Media Gallery, Document Library, Audio Library, Storage Analytics, Soft Delete & Recycle Bin, and Bulk ZIP downloads.

---

## 🏛️ System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    Client[Browser Client - Vanilla JS & Glassmorphism UI] --> APIGateway[FastAPI Application Server]
    
    subgraph Core AI & Multimodal Engines
        APIGateway --> ProviderMgr[AI Model Provider Manager]
        ProviderMgr --> Gemini[Google Gemini Provider]
        ProviderMgr --> OpenAI[OpenAI GPT-4o Provider]
        ProviderMgr --> Anthropic[Anthropic Claude Provider]
        ProviderMgr --> Ollama[Local Ollama / Llama 3]
        
        APIGateway --> VisionEngine[Vision AI Engine & OCR]
        APIGateway --> ImageGen[Text-to-Image Engine]
        APIGateway --> AudioEngine[Voice Recorder & STT Engine]
        APIGateway --> DocEngine[Document Intelligence & RAG]
    end

    subgraph Memory & Knowledge RAG System
        APIGateway --> MemoryEngine[Long-Term Memory Manager]
        APIGateway --> KnowledgeEngine[Knowledge Base & Collection Manager]
        APIGateway --> VectorSearch[Hybrid Vector Search & RAG]
        VectorSearch --> Qdrant[(Qdrant Vector DB)]
    end

    subgraph Cloud Workspace & Storage
        APIGateway --> ProjectMgr[Projects & Folders Manager]
        APIGateway --> FileManager[File Manager & ZIP Exporter]
        APIGateway --> DashMgr[Workspace Analytics & Usage Dashboard]
        APIGateway --> RecycleBin[Soft Delete & Recycle Bin Manager]
    end

    subgraph Data & Storage Layer
        APIGateway --> RelationalDB[(PostgreSQL 16 / SQLite Fallback)]
        APIGateway --> RedisCache[(Redis 7 Cache / Task Broker)]
        APIGateway --> StoragePath[Local Storage System]
    end
```

---

## ⚙️ Core Features

### 1. Unified Multimodal AI Chat Engine
- Multi-provider AI dispatch with retry backoff logic (Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama).
- Context-preserving chat threads with live switching between models.

### 2. Document Intelligence & Knowledge RAG
- Extract text and tables from PDFs, DOCX, CSV, and plain text.
- Chunking strategies with Qdrant vector embedding indexing.

### 3. Vision AI & Image Generation
- OCR text extraction from screenshots, charts, graphs, and handwritten notes.
- High-definition AI image generation with aspect ratio (`1:1`, `16:9`, `9:16`) and style controls.

### 4. Speech-to-Text & Audio Recorder
- Built-in browser audio recording widget with real-time waveform visualization.
- Audio file uploads (`.mp3`, `.wav`, `.m4a`, `.flac`) with transcript generation.

### 5. Long-Term Memory Dashboard
- Store key user preferences, technical specifications, and personal facts.
- Automatic conversation summarization and memory compression.

### 6. Cloud Workspace & Productivity System
- **Projects & Folders**: Organize chats and files into custom-colored project workspaces.
- **Media, Document & Audio Libraries**: Specialized galleries with quick preview and star filters.
- **Recycle Bin**: Soft-delete items with instant restore and permanent purge options.
- **Storage Analytics**: Real-time storage meter, file distribution breakdown, and activity timeline.
- **Bulk Operations**: Multi-file select and single-click ZIP archive downloads.

