## 🛰️ API Reference Overview

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `/api/v1/chat/completions` | `POST` | Send prompt for multimodal AI chat response |
| `/api/v1/chat/conversations` | `GET` | List active chat conversations |
| `/api/v1/image/analyze` | `POST` | Vision AI analysis & OCR on images |
| `/api/v1/image/generate` | `POST` | Text-to-Image generation |
| `/api/v1/document/upload` | `POST` | Upload & ingest document into RAG vector index |
| `/api/v1/audio/transcribe` | `POST` | Speech-to-text audio transcription |
| `/api/v1/memory` | `GET / POST` | Manage long-term user memories |
| `/api/v1/knowledge/collections` | `GET / POST` | Knowledge base collection management |
| `/api/v1/projects` | `GET / POST` | Create and manage workspace projects |
| `/api/v1/files/bulk-download` | `POST` | Download selected files as a ZIP archive |
| `/api/v1/workspace/recycle-bin` | `GET` | List soft-deleted files in Recycle Bin |
| `/api/v1/workspace/search` | `POST` | Cross-entity global workspace search |
| `/api/v1/dashboard/overview` | `GET` | Retrieve workspace storage & usage analytics |

